# Known high and critical vulnerabilities in the third-party images of docker-compose.yml that
# this repository cannot fix itself (SCF-AC-5.3). Every entry needs a reason and expires at the
# end of Sprint 2; after that the container scan fails again until the image is replaced or the
# entry is renewed with a new reason. SCF-US-2 slice 2 (#103, SCF-AC-2.5) moved every image to the
# newest tag of its pinned version on 2026-10-27; the entries below are those no image fixes yet.
# Found with Trivy 0.69.3 on 2026-10-13 and 2026-10-27, unfixed vulnerabilities are not reported
# (--ignore-unfixed).

# gosu in postgres:18-alpine and mongo:8.0 is built with an old Go standard library (and
# golang.org/x/net); gosu only drops root privileges at container start and opens no network
# connection. Upstream must rebuild it.
CVE-2025-61726 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2025-61729 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2025-68121 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-25679 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-27145 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-32280 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-32281 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-32283 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-33811 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-33814 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-33818 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-39820 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-39821 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-39822 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-39836 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-42499 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-42504 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-56853 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-56858 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-56859 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-56860 exp:2026-11-23
CVE-2026-56862 exp:2026-11-23
